<article class="env-lemma" id="08YC">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/08YC">Lemma <span data-tag="08YC">5.12.5</span>.</a> Let $X$ be a quasi-compact Hausdorff space. Let $E \subset X$. The following are equivalent: (a) $E$ is closed in $X$, (b) $E$ is quasi-compact. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      The implication (a) $\Rightarrow $ (b) is Lemma <a href="/tag/005C" data-tag="005C">5.12.3</a>. The implication (b) $\Rightarrow $ (a) is Lemma <a href="/tag/08YB" data-tag="08YB">5.12.4</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>